<h1>"Learning Enjoyed Like a Game, Run & Learn"</h1>
<img width="800" height="450" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/554f0465-63d7-46d0-9320-ee9bfed84249" />


# 🩵 Project Introduction & Purpose of Development
Today, many students suffer from a **lack of concentration** and **low motivation** in their learning process, and the **learning gap** for students who are in environments with limited access to educational resources is gradually widening. These issues go beyond individual limitations and lead to **educational inequality**.  

**Run & Learn** is an **educational RPG project** developed to solve these problems by combining **AI-based learning** with **gamified immersion elements**. 
Players can solve problems generated in real-time by AI while talking to NPCs in the game, allowing them to learn naturally while enjoying the game.  

Ultimately, the goal of this project is to **bridge the educational gap and provide equitable learning opportunities for all students**.

